  <p>The <a href="/resources/insights/tmall-product-image-requirements">Tmall product image requirements article</a> covers the other four main images and the detail page. The <a href="/resources/insights/jd-image-requirements-vs-tmall">article comparing JD image requirements with Tmall</a> covers the slot difference between the two platforms. The <a href="/solutions/ai-production/image">AI image production page</a> covers producing clean white-background variants from an approved master.</p>

